| `PYTEST_ADDOPTS` | string | unset | shell-quoted pytest options | pytest; `tests/selection_guard.py` | Adds pytest arguments; a full gate refuses `-k`, `-m`, node ids and `--deselect`, including attached and `=` forms, and malformed quoting; every token must match the harmless flag/value allowlist at `tests.full_gate_options`. The Makefile preflight uses `ExitCode.USAGE` (2); `--keel-full-gate` checks the actual pytest invocation. | forwarding through `make verify` or the gate runner: `child_env.names` omits it, so their children never receive it; tiers and direct pytest may narrow and write no gate evidence | always |
